---
import ProsePage from '../../components/ProsePage.astro';
import PillButton from '../../components/PillButton.astro';
import { withBase } from '../../i18n';
import { pageSeo } from '../../seo';
const seo = pageSeo.en['/en/meditationpractice'];
---

<ProsePage locale="en" currentPath="/en/meditationpractice" title={seo.title} description={seo.description}>
	<p>For thousands of years, across many spiritual traditions, people have sat in simple, present-moment awareness.</p>
	<p>
		Meditation is a simple practice, though not always an easy one — a commitment to sit for a set
		period and observe without judgment or reaction.
	</p>
	<p>
		Sitting with a group and a guide brings real advantages: it strengthens commitment and makes it
		possible to work through difficulties through shared conversation.
	</p>
	<p><strong>Sangha</strong> — a group of people practicing together and supporting one another through learning and growth.</p>
	<p>Two active meditation groups — in Tel Aviv and in Moshav Tal Shahar.</p>
	<h2>Guided recordings library</h2>
	<p>The recordings library is for group members and password-protected — contact Oded if you're a participant without a password.</p>
	<p class="cta">
		<PillButton href={withBase('/en/meditationlibrary')} variant="outline">Go to the recordings library</PillButton>
	</p>
</ProsePage>

<style>
	.cta {
		margin-top: var(--space-3);
	}
</style>
